stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> running: worker or request handler claims run
  queued --> cancelled: user cancels before start
  running --> streaming: response events available
  streaming --> running: tool or agent step continues
  running --> waitingApproval: policy requires approval
  waitingApproval --> running: approved and reauthorized
  waitingApproval --> cancelled: rejected or expired
  running --> completed: validated response or verified outcome
  running --> failed: unrecoverable error
  running --> cancelled: user cancellation
  failed --> queued: retryable background work only
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
